{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-05_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-05","title":"Call","storyCode":"3-5","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8bf62e6c592441cdc16d6ffb6a1aeea40d69236873c17df3a836ca65f5741513","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Amiya lashes out violently, and in a flash of sparks and flame, Skullshatterer falls to the ground.\nReunion rushes back, disregarding everything to bring back Skullshatterer's body.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十七关（前）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I didn't mean to... I..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"The fog has dispersed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"We've received communications from the L.G.D. They found more Reunion movements."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"They're currently tracking down one enemy, described as female with white hair--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, Ch'en told me that she wanted you to..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"...You don't look so good."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Let me handle it.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Well..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll leave her to you, Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"It'd be ideal to leave within 5 minutes."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Are you scared?","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh...? I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor... it's not like I'm afraid or anything..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course, I'm afraid... of losing you again... That's why..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I just... didn't mean to..."}]},{"label":"...Do you not like this power you have?","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I just don't know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know if I should be saying this, but..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It shouldn't... only be hurting other people."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want you to see me like this, up close..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...I took someone's life."}]},{"label":"Amiya, it's not your fault.","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I feel no regret."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No, what I mean is..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I will always use my power for your sake. No matter what kind of burden he was carrying, I don't regret killing him."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But... there should have been a better way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"He died because... I wasn't able to find it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"And that... is eating me up inside."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want you to see this side of me, {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even though I've always talked about freeing the Infected from pain and suffering..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But when matters the most, I have to persuade myself, again and again, that it's justified to take the life of another Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I am truly pathetic."}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Amiya, at least you protected me.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...This was my duty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I never believed that anything was already determined by fate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But, no matter what happens... no matter what I become..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll always protect you, Doctor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I promise."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"No!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"You all go first!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"I need to... I need to bring Skullshatterer back!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you insane?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"That's suicide... If you're going, we're all going together!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"All right!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't leave him alone out there..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go then!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Why..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Why is Reunion... turning back around?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"What are they doing...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Hoshiguma! Fall back!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D., don't panic!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Prepare for enemy attack!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Cover! Cover me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"That woman..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"It's impossible... We can't get past her shield!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Quick! Wrap around, before they have a chance to react..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to get to Skullshatterer... and bring him..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"And bring him home!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island! They're changing their target, watch out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh no!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Hoshiguma! Watch your right!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Hehe, you managed to block that? That's a bit interesting..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"An explosion? Another Reunion ambush?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Not just that, of course~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd like you to behave yourself and stay put right here. Don't think about turning back, all right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk... Where the hell did you come from?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Again with those explosives...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! I'm getting bombarded by Reunion!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Their forces are currently headed your way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm, that shield of yours is pretty sturdy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Seems like I've gotten myself into a bit of trouble..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Whatever, I'll just treat it like I'm doing Reunion a little favor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"Show me something entertaining. Make sure you don't let me down~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That's the 'W' person who we saw at Chernobog!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Could she... have managed to shake off Madam Ch'en? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful of the enemy assault! We've got to help Madam Hoshiguma right away!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"There are many more enemies hiding nearby!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We won't be able to get the upper hand unless we reveal them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor! Please lead our squads and hold off the enemy assault!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["Hoshiguma"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
